      "content": "REST API for Sarvam AI, India's full-stack sovereign AI platform. Provides chat completions over Sarvam's Indic LLMs, speech-to-text and speech-to-text-translate, text-to-speech, text translation, transliteration, and language identification across Indian languages. All requests authenticate with an api-subscription-key header.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Sarvam AI Support",
